  "title": "HitArea",
  "description": "Acceptable shapes for RenderNode.hitArea, expressed in the node's own local space: a Rectangle, Circle, Ellipse or Polygon, or `null` for no override. A `Polygon` may be concave - containment is an even-odd ray cast, not a convex test - so an L-shaped or ring-like pick region behaves as drawn.",
